        "Description": "Good day, 47. We have intel on 5 undercover Providence agents attending the Dartmoor garden show. We have important info we need to recover, but your job is eliminating the agents, We&apos;ll do the rest. The Providence agents have shock detectors, which will activate if they are shot, and a bodyguard next to them, so hiding the bodies is a must. Happy hunting 47.",
